6484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.poster.avif?t=1765265539\" width=616 height=230 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.webm?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3417470/extras/226484a82d6ab3eb7954ab8806bab65a.mp4?t=1765265539\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Gather collectible photos as you complete stories and challenges. Each photo unlocks a memory or reveals a hidden piece of the mystery.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Ready to turn the last page and face what lingers beyond?</h2>",
